      <li><strong>Old Shingle Tear-Off:</strong> $100 to $175 per square per layer (including labor and dumpster fees).</li>
      <li><strong>Damaged Plywood Decking:</strong> $65 to $110 per 4x8 ft sheet of CDX plywood or OSB sheathing.</li>
      <li><strong>Ice & Water Shield Upgrade:</strong> $75 to $125 per square of self-adhering eaves/valley membrane.</li>
      <li><strong>Ridge Vent System:</strong> $12 to $22 per linear foot installed with matching cap shingles.</li>
